<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Veritas Institute Medical Hospital</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #e8e1d7;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-main: #3d352c;
            --text-muted: #73695c;
            --accent-color: #6c6655;
            --accent-hover: #585344;
            --border-color: #d3c9bc;
            --shadow-subtle: 0 10px 30px rgba(61, 53, 44, 0.06);
            --shadow-hover: 0 16px 40px rgba(61, 53, 44, 0.12);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 24px 60px;
            max-width: 1400px;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 0 auto;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 40px;
            list-style: none;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #4f463c;
            transition: color 0.2s ease;
            position: lative;
            padding-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover, .nav-links a.active {
            color: #1a1612;
        }

        .nav-links a.active::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 2px;
            background-color: #4f463c;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .btn-appointment {
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 13px 26px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(108, 102, 85, 0.25);
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }

        .btn-appointment:hover {
            background-color: var(--accent-hover);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(108, 102, 85, 0.35);
        }

   
        .hero-section {
            max-width: 1100px;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 20px auto 40px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 45px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .hero-logo-wrapper {
            flex-shrink: 0;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .hero-logo {
            width: 140px;
            height: 140px;
            object-fit: contain;
            border-radius: 50%;
        }

        .hero-content h1 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #2c251f;
            line-height: 1.15;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .hero-tagline {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.2px;
        }

        .search-container {
            max-width: 820px;
            width: calc(100% - 40px);
            margin: 0 auto 55px auto;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 10px 10px 10px 24px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(61, 53, 44, 0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .search-container:focus-within {
            box-shadow: 0 16px 45px rgba(61, 53, 44, 0.14);
            border-color: var(--border-color);
        }

        .search-icon {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            fill: #9c9183;
            margin-right: 14px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .search-container input {
            flex: 1;
            border: none;
            outline: none;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            color: var(--text-main);
            background: transparent;
        }

        .search-container input::placeholder {
            color: #b0a495;
        }

        .search-btn {
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 14px 34px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(108, 102, 85, 0.2);
        }

        .search-btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--accent-hover);
        }

      
        .cards-grid {
            max-width: 1120px;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 0 auto 70px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 28px;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 24px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
            border-color: var(--border-color);
        }

        .card-img-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            height: 160px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            background-color: #f0ece6;
        }

        .card-img-wrapper img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }

        .card:hover .card-img-wrapper img {
            transform: scale(1.04);
        }

        .card-body {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .card-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #f2ece3;
            color: #7a6e5d;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #e4dacb;
        }

        .card h3 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 19px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #2c251f;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .card p {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Responsive Design */
        @media (max-width: 960px) {
            header {
                padding: 20px 30px;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 20px;
            }
            .nav-links {
                gap: 20px;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                justify-content: center;
            }
            .hero-section {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
                gap: 20px;
                margin-top: 10px;
            }
            .cards-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                max-width: 500px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .hero-content h1 {
                font-size: 32px;
            }
            .search-container {
                flex-direction: column;
                padding: 12px;
                border-radius: 20px;
                gap: 12px;
            }
            .search-container input {
                width: 100%;
                text-align: center;
                padding: 6px 0;
            }
            .search-btn {
                width: 100%;
            }
            .search-icon {
                display: none;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="#" class="active">HOME</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">ABOUT US</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">SERVICE & SPECIALITIES</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">CONTACT US</a></li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#" class="btn-appointment">Book an Appointment</a>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="hero-section">
            <div class="hero-logo-wrapper">
                <img src="logo1.jpg" alt="Veritas Institute Medical Hospital Logo" class="hero-logo">
            </div>
            <div class="hero-content">
                <h1>VERITAS INSTITUTE<br>MEDICAL HOSPITAL</h1>
                <div class="hero-tagline">Academic, highly professional, and trustworthy</div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="search-container">
            <svg class="search-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d="M15.5 14h-.79l-.28-.27C15.41 12.59 16 11.11 16 9.5 16 5.91 13.09 3 9.5 3S3 5.91 3 9.5 5.91 16 9.5 16c1.61 0 3.09-.59 4.23-1.57l.27.28v.79l5 4.99L20.49 19l-4.99-5zm-6 0C7.01 14 5 11.99 5 9.5S7.01 5 9.5 5 14 7.01 14 9.5 11.99 14 9.5 14z"/>
            </svg>
            <input type="text" placeholder="Search for doctors, specialties, services, or departments">
            <button class="search-btn">Search</button>
        </div>

        <div class="cards-grid">
            <a href="#" class="card">
                <div>
                    <div class="card-img-wrapper">
            
                        <img src="card1.png" alt="Hospital Building">
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <span class="card-badge">About U</span>
                        <h3>Our Heritage & Care</h3>
                        <p>Discover our history, mission, and commitment to world-class medical education and patient care.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </a>

      
            <a href="#" class="card">
                <div>
                    <div class="card-img-wrapper">
                        <img src="card2.png" alt="Specialist in scrubs">
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <span class="card-badge">Service & Specialist</span>
                        <h3>Comprehensive Departments</h3>
                        <p>Explore our comprehensive medical departments and find expert physicians tailored to your needs.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </a>

        
            <a href="#" class="card">
                <div>
                    <div class="card-img-wrapper">
                        <img src="card3.png" alt="Patient consultation">
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <span class="card-badge">Book an Appointment</span>
                        <h3>Easy Consultation Booking</h3>
                        <p>Schedule a consultation easily with our online booking system.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </a>
        </div>
    </main>

</body>
</html>
